# C04：箭头表示绑定查找与初始化检查，不表示语句的执行顺序。
direction: down

**.style.font-size: 22
**.style.border-radius: 10
(** -> **)[*].style.font-size: 20

read: 读取 warehouse
search: 按词法作用域\n从内向外找绑定
found: 找到了？ {
  shape: diamond
}
initialized: 已初始化？ {
  shape: diamond
}
missing: 未声明\nReferenceError {
  style.fill: "#fff1f0"
  style.stroke: "#cf1322"
}
tdz: TDZ\nReferenceError {
  style.fill: "#fff1f0"
  style.stroke: "#cf1322"
}
value: 读取值 {
  style.fill: "#f6ffed"
  style.stroke: "#389e0d"
}

read -> search
search -> found
found -> missing: 没找到
found -> initialized: 找到，停止外查
initialized -> tdz: 否
initialized -> value: 是
